{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00357","headline":"丈人观谒先帝御容 · 蜀太后徐氏","name":"丈人观谒先帝御容","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣帝归梧野，躬来谒圣颜。\n旋登三径路，似陟九嶷山。\n日照堆岚迥，云横积翠间。\n期修封禅礼，方俟再跻攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太后徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}